<title>USA: Denbury Resources completes reverse split.</title>
<headline>Denbury Resources completes reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denbury Resources Inc said it had consolidated its common stock on the basis of one share for each two issued.</p>
<p>As a result of the consolidation or reverse split, Denbury said it had about 11.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>It said it expected its shares to begin trading on the Toronto Stock Exchange and NASDAQ on October 17.</p>
<p>Due to the reverse split, the NASDAQ trading symbol will be &quot;DENFD&quot; for about 20 days before becoming &quot;DENRF&quot; again, it said.</p>
</text>
